---
title: Ways to Give
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /give/
wide: true
hero_heading: Ways to give
hero_subtext: Every gift made today goes toward the lease or purchase of our first transitional home in Denton County.
meta_description: Support Oasis Women Center. Give financially, donate a vehicle or gift cards, volunteer your skills, or refer a woman who needs housing.
---

<section class="sec sec-dark" aria-labelledby="money-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="give-hero-card reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Give financially</span>
      <h2 id="money-h">The house is the whole ask.</h2>
      <p>Until that door opens, no woman moves in. That is the entire campaign, stated plainly.</p>
      {% if site.donation_url %}
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.donation_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Donate now
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=I%20would%20like%20to%20donate">
        Email us to give
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      <p class="fine">Online giving is being set up now. Email us in the meantime and we will send you everything you need.</p>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="fine">A registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, EIN {{ site.ein }}. Contributions are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-paper" aria-labelledby="inkind-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Give without writing a check</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="inkind-h">Not everything we need <em>is money</em>.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">Several of the gaps in our program are filled better by things and time than by dollars.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="index">

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Donate a vehicle</h3>
        <p>A reliable used car or 15 passenger van becomes transportation for women getting to work, court, treatment, and childcare. One vehicle serves many residents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Gift cards for rides and gas</h3>
        <p>Uber and Lyft gift cards, gas cards, and prepaid transit passes go straight to a resident who needs to get where she needs to be.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Furnish a room</h3>
        <p>A bed, a dresser, linens, a lamp. When the house opens, all four bedrooms have to be ready on day one, not month three.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <h3>Teach financial literacy</h3>
        <p>If you work in finance, accounting, banking, or coaching, we want you leading budgeting workshops. This is the volunteer role we are actively filling.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <h3>Donate professional services</h3>
        <p>Legal, accounting, counseling, trades, repairs. In-kind services are tracked and documented, and we provide a letter at year end.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="index-row reveal">
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        <h3>Become a monthly donor</h3>
        <p>Recurring gifts of any size are what will allow us to sign a lease or purchase with confidence. Predictable income is worth more to us than a one-time total.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-ink2" aria-labelledby="refer-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-body reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Refer a woman</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title" id="refer-h">Know someone <em>who needs this</em>?</h2>
        <p>If you work at a shelter, a treatment program, a hospital, a church, or an agency, and you are working with a woman who has completed recovery and has nowhere stable to go, tell us about her.</p>
        <p>We are building the referral pipeline now, so that no bed sits empty on the day the house opens.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:32px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Referral">
            Send a referral
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="split-visual reveal d2">
        <figure class="figure">
          <img src="/assets/images/photos/road-day.webp" alt="A quiet tree-lined residential street in bright morning daylight." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="inner reveal">
      <h2>Questions before <em>you give</em>?</h2>
      <p>Call {{ site.phone }} or email {{ site.email }}. A real person answers.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace('-', '') }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-glass" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
